-- ------------------------------------------------- demo accounts ----------
-- Apple and Google reviewers sign in as the customer; the same phone with a
-- fixed OTP reaches merchant mode because of the business_members row below.
-- Complete rows, the way Supabase Auth writes them: it ignores a user without
-- aud, role and instance_id, and fails reading NULL token columns. Each login
-- also needs an email identity. Auth stores phones without the leading +.
